# 基础词 Unit 02 短语

## 常考短语

- **can't afford to do sth**: 负担不起做某事 — We can't afford to ignore this problem. 我们不能忽视这个问题。
- **aim to do sth**: 旨在做某事 — The project aims to improve education. 该项目旨在改善教育。
- **set an aim**: 设定目标 — She set an aim to read 50 books this year. 她设定了今年读50本书的目标。
- **an amount of**: 大量的 — A large amount of time was wasted. 大量时间被浪费了。
- **analyze the data**: 分析数据 — The team analyzed the data carefully. 团队仔细分析了数据。
- **announce the results**: 公布结果 — The teacher announced the results of the exam. 老师公布了考试结果。
- **annual report**: 年度报告 — The company published its annual report. 公司发布了年度报告。
- **apart from**: 除…之外 — Apart from English, she also speaks French. 除英语外，她还会说法语。
- **it is apparent that**: 很明显 — It is apparent that he is lying. 很明显他在撒谎。
- **have an appetite for**: 对…有欲望 — She has an appetite for adventure. 她有冒险的欲望。
- **submit an application**: 提交申请 — He submitted an application for the scholarship. 他提交了奖学金申请。
- **appoint sb as**: 任命某人为 — He was appointed as chairman. 他被任命为主席。
- **I would appreciate it if**: 如果…我将不胜感激 — I would appreciate it if you could reply soon. 如果你能尽快回复，我将不胜感激。
- **an approach to**: …的方法 — What is your approach to teaching? 你的教学方法是什么？
- **be appropriate for**: 适合于 — This movie is not appropriate for children. 这部电影不适合儿童。
